  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Using a Calculator Tool com Claude\nIn este recipe, we'll demonstrate como para provide Claude com a simples calculator tool aquele isso can use para perform arithmetic operations based on usuário entrada. We'll define the calculator tool e show como Claude can interact com isso para solve mathematical problems."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 1: definir up the environment\n\nprimeiro, let's instalar the obrigatório libraries e definir up the Anthropic api cliente."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": nulo,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%pip install anthropic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 11,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from anthropic importar Anthropic\n",
        "\n",
        "client = Anthropic()\n",
        "MODEL_NAME = \"claude-3-opus-20240229\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 2: Define the calculator tool\nWe'll define a simples calculator tool aquele can perform basic arithmetic operations. The tool will take a mathematical expression as entrada e retorna the resultado. \n\nNota aquele we are calling ```eval``` on the outputted expression. este is bad practice e should não be used generally but we are doing isso para the purpose of demonstration."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 2,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "importar re\n",
        "\n",
        "def calculate(expression):\n",
        "    # Remove any non-digit or non-operator characters from the expression\n",
        "    expression = re.sub(r'[^0-9+\\-*/().]', '', expression)\n",
        "    \n",
        "    tentar:\n",
        "        # Evaluate the expression using the built-in eval() função\n",
        "        result = eval(expression)\n",
        "        retornar str(result)\n",
        "    except (SyntaxError, ZeroDivisionError, NameError, TypeError, OverflowError):\n",
        "        retornar \"Erro: Invalid expression\"\n",
        "\n",
        "tools = [\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"nome\": \"calculator\",\n",
        "        \"Descrição\": \"A simple calculator that performs basic arithmetic operations.\",\n",
        "        \"input_schema\": {\n",
        "            \"tipo\": \"objeto\",\n",
        "            \"Propriedades\": {\n",
        "                \"expression\": {\n",
        "                    \"tipo\": \"texto\",\n",
        "                    \"Descrição\": \"The mathematical expression to evaluate (e.g., '2 + 3 * 4').\"\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            },\n",
        "            \"required\": [\"expression\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    }\n",
        "]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "In Este exemplo, we define a calculate função aquele takes a mathematical expression as entrada, removes any non-digit ou non-operator characters using a regular expression, e então evaluates the expression using the built-in eval() função. se the evaluation is successful, the resultado is returned as a texto. se an erro occurs durante evaluation, an erro message is returned.\n\nWe então define the calculator tool com an entrada schema aquele expects a single expression property of tipo texto."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 3: Interact com Claude\nagora, let's see como Claude can interact com the calculator tool para solve mathematical problems."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 36,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input):\n",
        "    se tool_name == \"calculator\":\n",
        "        retornar calculate(tool_input[\"expression\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "def chat_with_claude(user_message):\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\n{'='*50}\\nUser Message: {user_message}\\n{'='*50}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    message = client.messages.create(\n",
        "        model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "        max_tokens=4096,\n",
        "        messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_message}],\n",
        "        tools=tools,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nInitial Response:\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Stop Reason: {message.stop_reason}\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Content: {message.content}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    se message.stop_reason == \"tool_use\":\n",
        "        tool_use = next(block para block in message.content se block.tipo == \"tool_use\")\n",
        "        tool_name = tool_use.nome\n",
        "        tool_input = tool_use.entrada\n",
        "\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nTool Used: {tool_name}\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Tool entrada: {tool_input}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "        tool_result = process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input)\n",
        "\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Tool Result: {tool_result}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "        response = client.messages.create(\n",
        "            model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "            max_tokens=4096,\n",
        "            messages=[\n",
        "                {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_message},\n",
        "                {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": message.content},\n",
        "                {\n",
        "                    \"role\": \"user\",\n",
        "                    \"content\": [\n",
        "                        {\n",
        "                            \"tipo\": \"tool_result\",\n",
        "                            \"tool_use_id\": tool_use.id,\n",
        "                            \"content\": tool_result,\n",
        "                        }\n",
        "                    ],\n",
        "                },\n",
        "            ],\n",
        "            tools=tools,\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    senão:\n",
        "        response = message\n",
        "\n",
        "    final_response = next(\n",
        "        (block.text para block in response.content se hasattr(block, \"text\")),\n",
        "        None,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    imprimir(response.content)\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nFinal Response: {final_response}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    retornar final_response"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 4: tentar isso out!\n\nLet's tentar giving Claude a poucos example math questions agora aquele isso has access para a calculator."
